# The epilogue (docs/guide/built-with-itself.md).
title: aayudha was built through its own gates, and every exception was written down
direction: down
plan: A build plan, attacked by four reviewers
threads: Parallel agent threads build it
gates: Each pull request through its own gates
bypass: Solo-mode bypasses, each recorded
audit: audit reconciles them with GitHub
evals: Evals fail five rounds; the bar changes in the open
open: What is still open, listed
plan -> threads
threads -> gates
gates -> bypass: no second person
bypass -> audit
gates -> evals: skills
audit -> open
evals -> open
